WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.110
Every day, NASA paints the whole planet.

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:08.110
Terra Tunes plays those paintings as music.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:14.880
Nine records, nine worlds. Drop the needle, and the Earth starts to sing.

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:20.080
Every note, every measurement, waiting in the Data Deck.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.070
Scan a frame of your own, and it sings too.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:29.180
Terra Tunes. The Earth, on the turntable.
